            "block_content": "[V2G20-2522]\nOnce the sender sends the data to the certificate provisioning service (CPS) for verification and signature generation, the sender shall irretrievably erase/delete/destroy the contract certificate private keys (both the encrypted and unencrypted format), ECDHE private key and the session key as generated in 7.9.2.5.3.",
